<title>CANADA: Canada C$2.4 bln bond due 2007 yields 7.458 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$2.4 bln bond due 2007 yields 7.458 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$2.4 billion auction of 7.25 percent bonds due June 1, 2007 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     7.458	98.473  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     7.452	98.517  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    7.465	98.423   31.75182</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on October 1. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$5,438.5 million, including C$68.5 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$2.4 billion.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
